# Staccato (bow stops on the string) in eighths, then the same line spiccato
# (bow thrown, strings ring).
tempo 100
0 dyn 0.6
0 vib 0.3
0 art staccato
0 note D3 0.4 90
0.5 note E3 0.4 80
1 note F#3 0.4 80
1.5 note G3 0.4 80
2 note A3 0.4 90
2.5 note G3 0.4 80
3 note F#3 0.4 80
3.5 note E3 0.4 80
4 note D3 0.4 100
6 art spiccato
6 note D3 0.4 90
6.5 note E3 0.4 80
7 note F#3 0.4 80
7.5 note G3 0.4 80
8 note A3 0.4 90
8.5 note G3 0.4 80
9 note F#3 0.4 80
9.5 note E3 0.4 80
10 note D3 0.4 100
